{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial","id":561330,"title":"Out of the loop - Beast: the Primordial?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-19T16:46:50-07:00","id":561330,"title":"Out of the loop - Beast: the Primordial?","content":"I've lost touch with the World of Darkness games lately, but the news of 2nd editions brought me back. And then I see walls upon walls of threads about Beast: the Primordial.<br /> <br /> I take that it's a new game, but what's it about? Can someone explain to me what it is about/like in a post? Also, how do people feel about it? (I figure &quot;enthusiastic&quot; given the amount of threads, but I'd like to take a peep at the thoughts.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3365-szp","name":"szp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3365_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T16:55:21-07:00","id":561347,"title":"","content":"I would hate to make it sound more or less cool than it is, so here are the link to the developer blogs. I'm actually running a playtest game and I really like the game so far.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/category/worlds/worldofdarkness/beasttheprimordial/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/category/worl...theprimordial/</a><br /> <br /> Here is the link to the Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/beast-the-primordial-prestige-edition/comments\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...ition/comments</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2545-ninjar","name":"Ninjar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2545_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T17:21:39-07:00","id":561394,"title":"","content":"The long of it is, click that Kickstarter link. You can read the entirety of the first draft of the book there for free. The game is undergoing revisions due to feedback; check the updates section for the latest on that.<br /> <br /> The short of it is, you're Grendel and Smaug with a dash of Freddy Krueger. There's a little bit of primal dread in your makeup, a dark little hollow in the soul of the world, and it wants, and it needs. It feels good to hoard, or to punish, or to lay waste. It brings clarity. Bringing meaning with it, though, that part's up to you.<br /> <br /> There was also Demon: the Descent, if you missed that; not sure when you fell back. That one's about gnostic liars collecting false lives to conceal themselves from the harsh celestial light.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T17:27:19-07:00","id":561399,"title":"","content":"I'm not too up-to-date on Demon but<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> gnostic liars collecting false lives to conceal themselves from the harsh celestial light </div> </div> </div>I'm sold. Like. Oh my God. How did I miss this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3365-szp","name":"szp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3365_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T18:10:11-07:00","id":561426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>szp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=561399#post561399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not too up-to-date on Demon but<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I'm sold. Like. Oh my God. How did I miss this</div> </div> </div> </div>Demon is fuckin' awesome. Strong concept, strong character focus, cool powers, fun game. A lot of people have trouble getting past the initial aesthetic (my suggestion is, when you read about fallen angels with steel frames and plasma drives, keep in mind the glowing wheels of Ezekiel and the living creatures of Revelation \u2014 lot of traditional angels aren't that far off in how bizarre they are), but you can easily find out whether you dig it because, while the Kickstarter ended a long while ago, <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition/description\" target=\"_blank\">its page</a> still links to the pre-layout text of the book for free, like Beast does. I have huge respect for the show of faith Onyx Path demonstrates with these transparent Kickstarter projects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T18:18:33-07:00","id":561430,"title":"","content":"Demon is also 40% off this week.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/124155/Demon-The-Descent?src=salepage\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/4261/124155.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/124155/Demon-The-Descent?src=salepage\" target=\"_blank\"> Demon: The Descent - Onyx Path Publishing | Demon: The Descent | Demon: The Descent | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/124155/Demon-The-Descent?src=salepage\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/124155/Demon-The-Descent?src=salepage </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Demon: The Descent - Angels are everywhere. They are under the everyday world, behind it, beyond it. They are sent by the God-Machine to enac </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T18:26:21-07:00","id":561457,"title":"","content":"$80 for the Premium Hardcover?<br /> <br /> Remind me to ask the guys behind financial logistics how the Prestige Edition cost less than that. I'm genuinely interested in how that worked out.<br /> <br /> Bringing this back around, may I use that as a good reason to back Beast the Primordial while it's in Kickstarter. It costs less and is a better product overall, so basically it's win-win <i>on top of </i>being a cool urban epic horror story-game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T19:09:06-07:00","id":561485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=561457#post561457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remind me to ask the guys behind financial logistics how the Prestige Edition cost less than that. I'm genuinely interested in how that worked out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Printing books in bulk, with a set number of copies to be produced determined ahead of time, is cheaper than printing and binding individual books at irregular intervals in response to individual orders, I would assume is the largest factor. Especially when you don't own the printers and compare the cost of a single print run versus having on-going availability because you don't know when customers are going to want a book and you don't have a warehouse to store pre-printed books in ahead of time.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=561457#post561457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bringing this back around, may I use that as a good reason to back Beast the Primordial while it's in Kickstarter. It costs less and is a better product overall, so basically it's win-win <i>on top of </i>being a cool urban epic horror story-game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, anybody who thinks Beast is cool, wants to have a hard copy eventually, and can afford it should absolutely go in for the Kickstarter prestige edition. You get a fantastic deal on these nWoD Kickstarters. Not only do you get a nicer-produced book for less, but you get the electronic copy earlier than anybody else, and you end up getting all the stretch goal PDF material on top of that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T22:35:39-07:00","id":561596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=561394#post561394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The short of it is, you're Grendel and Smaug with a dash of Freddy Krueger. There's a little bit of primal dread in your makeup, a dark little hollow in the soul of the world, and it wants, and it needs. It feels good to hoard, or to punish, or to lay waste. It brings clarity. Bringing meaning with it, though, that part's up to you.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's Jung/Joseph Campbell the game basically.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T00:15:18-07:00","id":561650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=561426#post561426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demon is fuckin' awesome. Strong concept, strong character focus, cool powers, fun game. A lot of people have trouble getting past the initial aesthetic (my suggestion is, when you read about fallen angels with steel frames and plasma drives, keep in mind the glowing wheels of Ezekiel and the living creatures of Revelation \u2014 lot of traditional angels aren't that far off in how bizarre they are).</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, the Terminator/Transformer aesthetic is really strong and in your face the moment you start reading the book. Accepting that, the book is really great and covers the spy angle wonderfully. Don't let the aesthetic turn you away; it can easily be re skinned because the aesthetic is just symbolism.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2447-twitchtherat","name":"TwitchTheRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2447_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T05:30:27-07:00","id":561806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwitchTheRat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=561650#post561650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be fair, the Terminator/Transformer aesthetic is really strong and in your face the moment you start reading the book. Accepting that, the book is really great and covers the spy angle wonderfully. Don't let the aesthetic turn you away; it can easily be re skinned because the aesthetic is just symbolism.</div> </div> </div> </div>They can be played as &quot;machine monsters&quot; or as old school angels / demons. In my games I reskinned them most of the time to the later without any problem (as it was only an optical reskinning and maybe calling powers differently^^)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T06:13:32-07:00","id":561829,"title":"","content":"Some of the sample demons don't even look that tech-y. One is a sort of living shadow thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T19:10:25-07:00","id":562502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=561596#post561596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's Jung/Joseph Campbell the game basically.</div> </div> </div> </div>Jung, yes, Joseph Campbell, more like the anti-form of that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T19:48:29-07:00","id":562519,"title":"","content":"@szp a big part of the premise is kind of like a genius loci, your HQ location is also your power trait. As the lair gains more power you can also add traits that enhance your &quot;home&quot; (including symbolic powers like an echo of your voice or &quot;patch&quot; of darkness to hide in, and more physical powers like earthquakes, floods, and tidal currents).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T20:20:12-07:00","id":562536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=562502#post562502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jung, yes, Joseph Campbell, more like the anti-form of that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough, I just meant that he was a clear central influence. But you're right that it's an intentional inversion in terms of the protagonism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T12:48:21-07:00","id":568256,"title":"","content":"So it sounds to me as if in very simplified terms it's <i>Nightbreed: The Roleplaying Game</i>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T14:47:05-07:00","id":568401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/561330-out-of-the-loop-beast-the-primordial?p=568256#post568256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So it sounds to me as if in very simplified terms it's <i>Nightbreed: The Roleplaying Game</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>A bit, yeah.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}